  <table class="catalog">
    <tr><td>17</td><td><span class="kind">DEFECT</span> The download offer's file count and byte total describe different sets of files.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>18</td><td><span class="kind">DEFECT</span> A completed job is unreachable and undeletable on every non-Chromium browser.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>19</td><td><span class="kind">DEFECT</span> The same counting error is written into persistent storage.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>20</td><td><span class="kind">DEFECT</span> A user's own file named with a numeric suffix is misread as a browser collision rename.</td></tr>
